  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;be respectively the mean, mode and variance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> observations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>...</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>...</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>,</mi></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> is any number.</p><p><strong>Statement I:</strong> Variance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math> is <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>&#963;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math>.</p><p><strong>Statement II:</strong> Mean and mode of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math>, respectively.</p>"
  },
